From d2c28284ad900783e7ed5db9174c78716ddeb44b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:47:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] themes: add a glass look and a background image

- bbx_theme gets an optional glass part: translucent keys, buttons, text
  area, header and keyboard panel with translucent borders; the other
  themes leave it zeroed and stay opaque
- New theme plinius-glass: white glass over a wallpaper, yellow accent
- New option [theme] background: an LVGL binary image (XRGB8888) scaled
  once to cover the display, shown behind everything
---
