 ## Theme
-*default* = <adwaita-light|adwaita-dark|breezy-light|breezy-dark|nord-light|nord-dark|pmos-light|pmos-dark>
+*default* = <adwaita-light|adwaita-dark|breezy-light|breezy-dark|nord-light|nord-dark|pmos-light|pmos-dark|plinius-glass>
