@@ -71,6 +71,12 @@ for and, if found, merged in the following order:
 	Selects the alternative theme which the user can then choose on boot.
 	Default: breezy-dark.
 
+*background* = <path>
+	An image shown behind everything, scaled to cover the display: an LVGL
+	binary image in XRGB8888 format (lv_image_header_t followed by the pixels).
+	A small, blurred image is enough, it is scaled up once at start. Themes
+	with translucent surfaces (plinius-glass) need it. Default: none.
+
 ## Input
 *keyboard* = <true|false>
 	Enable or disable the use of hardware keyboards. Default: true.
